    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17979" root="زلج" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَلَجَى</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَزَى</span> [in measure and meaning],
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَلِيجَةٌ</span></b> , (K, TA,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَلُوجٌ</span></b> , (TA,) applied
to a she-camel, <i>Quick,</i> or <i>swift,</i> (K, TA,) <i>in
pace,</i> or <i>journeying:</i> or, as some say, <i>that quickly
finishes in being milked.</i> (TA.)

